The cage mesh and rotor geometry are from the PX4 Gazebo Classic Omnicopter
by Jaeyoung Lim. The propeller meshes are the CW and CCW meshes from Iris.
The source meshes were converted to GLB. The rotor GLBs include a local
rotation clip for PteroSim.

